  "description": "Once known as the ultimate killer, \"Knife Rabbit\" retired and lived a quiet life under the name of chef \"Goya.\" One day, he senses an indescribable, enchanting scent from a girl named \"Jin Seo-Nu\" who visits his restaurant. Pursuing her are his former colleagues, former killers, and \"natural enemies.\" These enemies, intent on completing their mission, and Goya, the chef, desperate to monopolize the scent, their desires and instincts surrounding the girl become intertwined.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
